# Tool caches from a working checkout. Release builds come from a clean
# worktree, but a local build otherwise copies several hundred MB of them into
# /app. pyproject.toml points pytest, ruff and mypy at .cache/.
**/.cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.jekyll-cache
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
env
venv
ENV
env.bak
venv.bak
recordings
.DS_Store
.vscode
nojoin/
docs/*
!docs/VERSION
Nojoin.py
README.md
LICENSE
*.wav
data/
.env
.env.*
# Never bake TLS private keys or certificates into images. None are tracked;
# this stops locally generated material (e.g. nginx/cert.key from
# docker/init-ssl.sh) from leaking into a local build context. The **/ prefix is
# required to match nested paths — a bare *.key only matches the context root.
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
